        <rule id="63b2cffa-8657-5a6b-a2ca-84fb2ea3c97e" name="Pack" hidden="false">
          <description>6” Aura, this model and target unit gains a 4+ Feel No Pain. For each roll of a 1 on a Feel No Pain, the target unit or model suffers 1 Mortal Wound.</description>
