      <rules>
        <rule id="f1c8d4d2-331d-576e-b0c1-476b65be76f4" name="Unleash the Squigs of War" hidden="false">
          <description>Token. During the Shooting Phase, the unit may choose to Release the Bomb Squigs. If they do so, nominate an enemy unit and roll 2d6 for each Squig. If the Squig makes contact with an enemy model it stays put. Determine the final resting position of all Bomb Squigs, then resolve their Bomb Squig attack centering the Blast Template on them without scattering it. Remove the Squigs from the game afterwards.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
