                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Friendly target unit is removed from the table and immediately Deepstrikes. This special Deepstrike does not grant the usual 4+ Cover Save. If targeting a Vehicle the Cast is 8+ instead.</characteristic>
