        <rule id="97c29e08-f8bd-5529-827b-cfc94c61e909" name="Teleporty Experiments" hidden="false">
          <description>Up to 1 unit for every 1000 points in your army may gain Deepstrike during Deployment. Double the Scatter distance rolled, and a Direct Hit cannot be scored (use the small arrow to determine direction). Each model deployed this way must take a Dangerous Terrain Test.</description>
