      <rules>
        <rule id="3a69f412-1e6b-5987-b077-49483980723c" name="Da Red Revolution" hidden="false">
          <description>Unit keyword / faction rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="8bf73007-0b77-5f4a-96cb-bdcf98aac8b6" name="Grot" hidden="false">
          <description>Unit keyword / faction rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="d3bd0269-a2c9-5128-8749-84ce1af4a05f" name="Epic Ascension" hidden="false">
          <description>When this model is Defeated, place the Unstable Ordnance 5” Template over this model and do not scatter it. Resolve the effects of the weapon. Only use with the Squigmobile Upgrade.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="dde69630-de8f-5b70-9798-c0dbfcce282f" name="Grot Revolutionary Committee" hidden="false">
          <description>If this model is destroyed, roll a d6. On a 2+ swap Da Red Gobbo out for one existing Grot Infantry model on the field instead of removing Da Red Gobbo from the game. The swapped Grot is removed from the game instead. The newly elected Da Red Gobbo loses any B upgrades it purchased. Have You Been A Good Little Grot This Year? – 6” Aura, target Grot Infantry models in the unit places a Non- Scattering 3” Blast template over them and inflicts S3 Ap- Hits. All Grot Infantry models are removed after resolving the Hits.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="7e183142-0d2f-5cfd-b21f-45bbcec36d05" name="Icon of Da Red Revolution" hidden="false">
          <description>In your Command Phase, you may spawn an existing Grot Infantry unit from your list that has been destroyed or declare an existing Grot Infantry unit dead by removing them from the fields. This replacement unit spawns inside your Deployment Zone. This may only occur once per Round and may affect the same unit any number of times over the course of the game.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4c681d33-4a41-581f-83a2-139885c32638" name="Packed Like Squigs" hidden="false">
          <description>This model counts as half a model for Transport Capacity.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
